sive alerts"}, {"id": "931988f7-9987-4a45-a191-8a96ecfb028e", "type": "concept", "title": "Override reasons and monitoring"}]}, {"id": "1fee0b70-4da7-4db8-be4d-1e93d5974c33", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Medication safety technologies", "description": "Students learn how informatics supports high-reliability medication practice.", "children": [{"id": "7a29dea1-28f7-4d51-9dac-f2c324e4b281", "type": "concept", "title": "CPOE, eMAR, barcode medication administration"}, {"id": "45a703b4-eb83-4ac9-a1e9-9538d55ed6aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Smart pumps and dose-range checking"}, {"id": "a8be01a1-581c-498d-a7f1-adf358a3382d", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication reconciliation and adverse drug event surveillance"}]}]}, {"id": "813de57d-17bf-4ccd-9e37-cf111179ec90", "type": "topic", "title": "Privacy, HIPAA, Cybersecurity, and Ethical Data Stewardship", "description": "This module teaches nurses to protect electronic health information, recognize security risks, and practice ethically in digital environments.", "children": [{"id": "832637b1-7957-4752-a416-5090c5a4b16e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "HIPAA and ePHI", "description": "Students learn core privacy and security obligations for electronic health information.", "children": [{"id": "290938aa-b74c-470e-bcac-7308972706b4", "type": "concept", "title": "Minimum necessary use"}, {"id": "01c8b883-7d72-4568-9142-521216b134b7", "type": "concept", "title": "Access, use, disclosure, and audit trails"}, {"id": "74bb0235-e580-44b2-b076-45c5bc4255c8", "type": "concept", "title": "Covered entities, business associates, and breach basics"}]}, {"id": "4ab127fb-3cb6-4eca-bcd5-22d379ddba33", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cybersecurity basics", "description": "Nurses are part of the security boundary.", "children": [{"id": "f799045e-0b56-401c-b082-9b5f44806981", "type": "concept", "title": "Phishing, passwords, MFA, ransomware, device security"}, {"id": "26d7a91e-a5cf-4ca0-a4b7-19147b16c3bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Administrative, physical, and technical safeguards"}, {"id": "7f7a72ee-a198-4abc-92bb-951f390bf79f", "type": "concept", "title": "Downtime and cyber incident response"}]}, {"id": "f7236dc4-3b85-4c10-ad48-dcb9e7ffa825", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ethical stewardship", "description": "Trust is central to digital care.", "children": [{"id": "1af7194a-e5ea-4cc1-b1de-e61dd02c7312", "type": "concept", "title": "Confidentiality and professional boundaries"}, {"id": "a4f9bbc9-aa45-4960-8cf8-0cb65d43f0ca", "type": "concept", "title": "Patient consent and secondary data use"}, {"id": "3503b9e9-df3d-4563-94ee-5fa69c1a9e94", "type": "concept", "title": "Equity, transparency, and accountability"}]}]}, {"id": "1aeaea04-8188-4c1a-89b6-5633c41e6d1a", "type": "topic", "title": "Telehealth, Remote Patient Monitoring, and Digital Therapeutics", "description": "Students learn how virtual care and remote monitoring change assessment, access, patient education, escalation, and continuity of care.", "children": [{"id": "67a1a4e0-773d-4182-9447-f6de0bacfaa4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Telehealth models", "description": "Students learn how virtual care changes access and assessment.", "children": [{"id": "07ab706b-1099-49b9-ba6e-ec4613293ca2", "type": "concept", "title": "Synchronous, asynchronous, store-and-forward, and hybrid care"}, {"id": "eef2ccbf-a896-4335-bdc3-7e81883e3f1c", "type": "concept", "title": "Teletriage and virtual nursing"}, {"id": "877a9b25-9f7b-4def-812d-7e6cf28216a3", "type": "concept", "title": "Licensure, consent, and emergency planning awareness"}]}, {"id": "d46e7cdf-11ce-473f-8c6f-26d7393f4cc7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Remote patient monitoring", "description": "RPM turns home data into clinical action.", "children": [{"id": "0802c28e-ada4-4234-ac37-b79e0565a864", "type": "concept", "title": "Vital signs, glucose, weight, oxygen saturation, blood pressure"}, {"id": "991c7088-4057-4494-9fbe-4fb8695f381c", "type": "concept", "title": "Escalation thresholds 