s for AI-enabled tools.", "children": [{"id": "c6166069-3992-4d12-b66c-6213b629e4b9", "type": "concept", "title": "Human oversight and scope of use"}, {"id": "9b625ea5-23f2-4447-aa43-1b3697bec410", "type": "concept", "title": "Documentation and disclosure"}, {"id": "c9ead61c-fec8-4e3a-ab23-09aef6dbb822", "type": "concept", "title": "Governance, accountability, and incident review"}]}]}, {"id": "d47c0d7f-132c-4153-bccf-7f1f3390c0ee", "type": "topic", "title": "Technology Implementation, Change Management, and Project Leadership", "description": "This module shows how health technology succeeds through stakeholder engagement, training, workflow integration, governance, and evaluation.", "children": [{"id": "653d0357-a015-4deb-9653-d58c041edbbb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Implementation lifecycle", "description": "Students learn what happens before, during, and after go-live.", "children": [{"id": "89693cfe-9a4b-413c-b594-f17f05749603", "type": "concept", "title": "Needs assessment, selection, build, testing, training, go-live, optimization"}, {"id": "5f44c76c-87b8-4a71-ab69-18e3ba1336a9", "type": "concept", "title": "Super users and command centers"}, {"id": "88fd00e0-b429-4961-8717-13eff0005d28", "type": "concept", "title": "Downtime and rollback planning"}]}, {"id": "627218d7-a5d9-4c98-b6d7-3243b4061f34", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Change management", "description": "Adoption is clinical, social, and organizational.", "children": [{"id": "bfceb200-066f-4616-bcb3-cca0c6c53ea6", "type": "concept", "title": "Stakeholder mapping"}, {"id": "81a58e29-520f-414c-aaa6-b4a5267b8d18", "type": "concept", "title": "Communication and training"}, {"id": "6d444fd1-bb7d-4dd9-b92f-7eea27f72a4e", "type": "concept", "title": "Resistance, feedback, and workflow redesign"}]}, {"id": "5a921f43-9954-438f-866f-a85458fde3d9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Project leadership", "description": "Nurses contribute essential clinical reality to health IT projects.", "children": [{"id": "31a